58
00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:35.580
The sentence was:
I wish you health, wealth, and happiness. 

59
00:04:36.780 --> 00:04:37.740
Here it is again:

60
00:04:45.000 --> 00:04:49.860
Okay, now I'm going to randomly pick
five of those sentences 

61
00:04:49.860 --> 00:04:53.759
and say them silently.
If you can recognize and remember 

62
00:04:53.760 --> 00:04:56.580
the sentences,
you are lipreading! 

63
00:04:57.180 --> 00:05:01.740
As always, the answers are written below.
Are you ready?

64
00:05:03.780 --> 00:05:05.220
Sentence A

65
00:05:11.820 --> 00:05:13.020
Sentence B

66
00:05:17.520 --> 00:05:19.080
Sentence C

67
